# --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/AsyncTest.lvl --frame-time 0.02
# Async on the game clock (CS-6), at a fixed 0.02 s frame: awaits, a tween and a coroutine land on
# the expected frames, and await resumes on the main thread.
wait-log dotnet ready | 7200
wait 30
play
wait-log AsyncProbe: coroutine waited until frame 11 | 600
wait-log AsyncProbe: coroutine resumed on frame 12 | 600
wait-log AsyncProbe: tween ended on frame 20 at 10.00 | 600
wait-log AsyncProbe: delay landed on frame 25 | 600
wait-log AsyncProbe: three frames later it is frame 28 | 600
wait-log AsyncProbe: Task.Delay resumed on the main thread: True | 600
stop
quit
